47994009ca.mp4?t=1758916472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt and survive:</strong> Fight against a wide range of robots, each with their unique characteristics. Shields, denial explosives, battlefield repairs - each enemy twists and changes the battle in unpredictable ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited supplies:</strong> Every bullet counts in the fight against the robotic menace. Use the environment to your advantage, set up traps, take cover - and flee when necessary to fight another day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push back and explore in a mission-based open world:</strong> Every corner of the island has new opportunities, discoveries, and dangers. Stay on the move, salvage vehicles, and piece together the complex story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445360/extras/38fe0f939a14bf65ece4dc475462b6ad.poster.avif?t=1758916472\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445360/extras/38fe0f939a14bf65ece4dc475462b6ad.webm?t=1758916472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445360/extras/38fe0f939a14bf65ece4dc475462b6ad.mp4?t=1758916472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadows of doubt:</strong> Humanity is no longer the only self-aware species on the planet. Every robot wants to kill you - or do they? Delve into  questions of morality and philosophy as you fight tooth and nail to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The machine island was supposed to be 